<Text size="xs">Extra small text</Text>
<Button size="sm">Small button</Button>

// ❌ WRONG - Over-engineered
<Heading level={6}>Small text</Heading>
<Button size="lg">Small button</Button>
```

## 📋 **Import Patterns**

### **Always Import from System Design**

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Import from system design
import {
  Button,
  Input,
  Select,
  Typography,
  Heading,
  Text,
  Link,
  Code,
  Blockquote,
  List,
  ListItem,
  Table,
  Form,
  Slider,
  Step,
  Navbar,
  LanguageSwitcher,
  LoadingSpinner,
  SimpleLoading,
} from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT - Import presets
import { SliderPresets, StepPresets } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT - Import types
import type {
  TableColumn,
  TableProps,
  TypographyProps,
  HeadingProps,
  TextProps,
  LinkProps,
} from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ❌ WRONG - Import from individual files
import Button from './components/Button';
import Input from './components/Input';
```

## 🚫 **Anti-Patterns to Avoid**

1. **Don't recreate existing components**
2. **Don't use arbitrary CSS classes for styling**
3. **Don't skip accessibility attributes**
4. **Don't use raw HTML when components exist**
5. **Don't modify component internals**
6. **Don't ignore responsive design**
7. **Don't use inconsistent spacing/sizing**
8. **Don't create custom layouts when MasterLayout exists**
9. **Don't use hardcoded colors when semantic colors exist**
10. **Don't skip form validation and error handling**

