## 🛠️ **Development Tools & Workflow**

### **Code Quality**

- **ESLint**: Next.js + TypeScript + Prettier integration
- **Prettier**: Code formatting with Next.js standards
- **Husky**: Git hooks for pre-commit checks
- **lint-staged**: Run linters on staged files only
- **commitlint**: Enforce conventional commit messages
- **commitizen**: Interactive commit tool

### **Available Scripts**

```bash
# Development
npm run dev                    # Start development server
npm run storybook             # Start Storybook

# Code Quality
npm run lint                  # Run ESLint
npm run lint:fix              # Fix ESLint issues
npm run lint:check            # Strict ESLint check
npm run format                # Format with Prettier
npm run format:check          # Check Prettier formatting
npm run check                 # Run both lint and format checks
npm run fix                   # Fix both lint and format issues

# Git Workflow
npm run commit                # Interactive commit with commitizen
git commit -m "type: message"  # Manual commit (validated by commitlint)

# Build
npm run build                 # Build all packages and app
npm run build:system-design   # Build system-design package
npm run build:blog           # Build blog package
npm run build-storybook      # Build Storybook
```

### **Git Hooks**

- **Pre-commit**: Runs lint-staged (ESLint + Prettier)
- **Commit-msg**: Validates commit message format

### **Commit Convention**

Follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/):

```bash
feat: add new feature
fix: resolve bug issue
docs: update documentation
style: format code
refactor: improve code structure
perf: optimize performance
test: add tests
build: update build system
ci: update CI configuration
chore: maintenance tasks
revert: revert previous commit
```

### **Internationalization**

- **next-intl**: i18n framework
- **Messages**: Located in `/messages/` directory
- **Locales**: Vietnamese (vi) and English (en)
- **LanguageSwitcher**: Component for locale switching

